# ERRORS

<!--
The terminal case for `environment` failures: the skill and trigger were correct
and the failure was external (an API outage, a missing dependency, stale state).
These get logged HERE and the environment gets fixed — they do NOT become a skill
edit. Logging an external failure as a skill learning makes a later pass "fix" a
skill that was never broken. Stop here for that one. See docs/05.
-->

## [ERR-YYYYMMDD-NNN] <one-line: what failed externally>
- **What happened:** <the external failure>
- **Skill/agent involved:** <which one ran — confirmed NOT at fault>
- **Environment fix:** <what was actually wrong outside the harness, and what fixed it>
- **Date:** YYYY-MM-DD
